Dear Gema,

sorry for the late reply. The analysis you describe does exist. It is called 'multispati', and was originally in ade4, now in adespatial:
https://rdrr.io/cran/adespatial/man/multispati.html

A different problem to LDA / DAPC or variants.

Best
Thibaut

